                        "richTextValue": "<div class=\"cgt-hero-copy\" id=\"donate\"><span class=\"cgt-tag\">Winter appeal 2026</span><h1>Keep their song in the forest.</h1><p>Every morning, gibbon families sing to mark their home. Your gift protects that home, and cares for the gibbons who lost theirs.</p></div>"
