              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "dxpStyle": {},
                        "imageInfos": "",
                        "richTextValue": "<div class=\"cgt-container cgt-work\" id=\"work\"><div class=\"cgt-section-head\"><span class=\"cgt-eyebrow\">Where your gift goes</span><h2>From rescue to release.</h2></div><div class=\"cgt-cards\"><div class=\"cgt-card\"><span class=\"cgt-card-icon cgt-icon-sun\"><img src=\"/canopy/sfsites/c/resource/canopyIconRescue\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h3>Rescue and care</h3><p>Gibbons taken from the pet trade get vet care, good food and time to recover at our rescue centre.</p></div><div class=\"cgt-card\"><span class=\"cgt-card-icon cgt-icon-leaf\"><img src=\"/canopy/sfsites/c/resource/canopyIconForest\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h3>Forest protection</h3><p>Ranger patrols and replanted corridors keep wild families connected and safe from logging.</p></div><div class=\"cgt-card\"><span class=\"cgt-card-icon cgt-icon-forest\"><img src=\"/canopy/sfsites/c/resource/canopyIconRelease\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h3>Back to the wild</h3><p>When they're ready, gibbons are released in protected forest and followed by our field team.</p></div></div></div>"
                      },
                      "definition": "community_builder:htmlEditor",
                      "id": "fad68ab5-88b9-4b6f-9614-ba0ee538e457",
